    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:04.787" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get to talk</p>
      <p begin="00:04.787" end="00:09.123" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get too blush</p>
      <p begin="00:09.123" end="00:13.448" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't here for love, you're here for standing up</p>
      <p begin="00:13.448" end="00:18.178" ttm:agent="v1">Draining my love</p>
      <p begin="00:18.178" end="00:22.298" ttm:agent="v1">So I really better not compromise</p>
      <p begin="00:22.298" end="00:26.581" ttm:agent="v1">Cuz' you annihilated my faith on you</p>
      <p begin="00:26.581" end="00:31.008" ttm:agent="v1">I know what kinda' needle create those eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:31.008" end="00:35.264" ttm:agent="v1">And still I'm lying here while I'm facing you</p>
      <p begin="00:35.264" end="00:39.676" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get to talk</p>
      <p begin="00:39.676" end="00:44.217" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get too blush</p>
      <p begin="00:44.217" end="00:48.667" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't here for love, you're here for standing up</p>
      <p begin="00:48.667" end="00:53.020" ttm:agent="v1">Draining my love</p>
      <p begin="00:53.020" end="00:57.129" ttm:agent="v1">Misinformation</p>
      <p begin="00:57.129" end="01:01.837" ttm:agent="v1">I see that ruby locket, It' s falling down your pocket</p>
      <p begin="01:01.837" end="01:06.001" ttm:agent="v1">You get the same buzz</p>
      <p begin="01:06.001" end="01:10.971" ttm:agent="v1">I see that ruby locket, It' s falling down your pocket</p>
      <p begin="01:10.971" end="01:15.004" ttm:agent="v1">So I really better not compromise</p>
      <p begin="01:15.004" end="01:19.435" ttm:agent="v1">Cuz' you annihilated my faith on you</p>
      <p begin="01:19.435" end="01:23.464" ttm:agent="v1">I know what kind of needle create those eyes</p>
      <p begin="01:23.464" end="01:27.573" ttm:agent="v1">And still I'm lying here while I'm facing you</p>
      <p begin="01:27.573" end="01:31.965" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get to talk</p>
      <p begin="01:31.965" end="01:36.343" ttm:agent="v1">You know you so bad so you don't get too blush</p>
      <p begin="01:36.343" end="01:40.736" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't here for love, you're here for standing up</p>
      <p begin="01:40.736" end="01:44.736" ttm:agent="v1">Draining my love</p>
    </div>
